<title>USA: Ballantyne of Omaha sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Ballantyne of Omaha sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballantyne of Omaha Inc said Wednesday it had declared a three-for-two split of its common stock, payable March 5, record February 10.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash, the company said.</p>
<p>Ballantyne said that after the split it will have 8,569,785 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
